  <revision rev="2" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>6701cad1e7c195b17bd6d919f021f157</srcmd5>
    <version>0.13.0</version>
    <time>1791394353</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- update to 0.13.0:
  * Add a set of write_buf() functions for writing JSON to a buffer
    without allocation.
  * Add YYJSON_FREESTANDING compile-time option to build without libc
  * Add YYJSON_DISABLE_FILE compile-time option to disable file/fp
    read and write APIs.
  * Add YYJSON_READER_DEPTH_LIMIT and YYJSON_WRITER_DEPTH_LIMIT
    compile-time options.
  * Add YYJSON_WRITE_LOWERCASE_HEX flag to write \uXXXX escapes in
    lowercase: #264.a
  * Add Swift Package Manager traits for compile-time configuration</comment>
    <requestid>1382857</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
